      value: Irate Customer
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[3].nameTag
      value: Irate Customer
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[4].nameTag
      value: Irate Customer
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[0].dialogueText
      value: The decal store's mascot, Goldenrock Sal!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[1].dialogueText
      value: He digs for gold in customers' pockets.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[2].dialogueText
      value: (And, according to rumor, in his nose, as well.)
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[0].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[3].dialogueText
      value: Fine! I'll make it myself.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[0].dialogueText
      value: The line starts behind the scary lady, in case you were wondering.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[1].dialogueText
      value: Hey! I'm not scary!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[2].dialogueText
      value: I'm a kawaii potato! The cutest, most non-threatening thing imaginable!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[3].dialogueText
      value: So, you watch your mouth or you'll be hearing from my lawyer!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1155657993595194405, guid: efd95256c89a0e549b3a64a469c98391, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _NPCLines.Array.data[1].dialogueBoxes.Array.data[4].dialogueText
      value: That's because *somebody* won't do my designs for me!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
